  #line-at(88.824pt, 285.41pt, "ABSTRACT ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(70.824pt, 314.09pt, "Thermoelectric generators (TEGs) based on commercially used thermal super-insulating ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 334.85pt, "materials can facilitate sustainable and large-scale ambient waste heat recovery while ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 355.49pt, "bequeathing an added economic and environmental value to thermal insulations in industry. ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 376.25pt, "This requires the optimization of the thermoelectric (TE) properties through electrical ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 396.89pt, "functionalization of such materials. Moreover, the associated engineering challenges of ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 417.65pt, "assembling TEG modules must be overcome. Herein, we propose using super-insulating ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 438.31pt, "Resorcinol-formaldehyde (RF) carbogels for scalable and sustainable TE applications through ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 459.07pt, "their electrical functionalization. Using a combination of a pyrolysis process and carbon fibers ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 479.71pt, "insertion, we achieved an increment by 12 orders of magnitude in electrical conductivity as well ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 500.47pt, "as ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(86.184pt, 500.47pt, "ZT")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(99.624pt, 500.47pt, " whilst retaining their intrinsic ultralow thermal conductivity (<50 mW/mK). A TE ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 521.11pt, "module in the form of a thermoelectric vacuum insulation panel (TVIP), was then fabricated ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 541.87pt, "using only a p-type material, to demonstrate a proof-of-concept self-powered WiFi-based ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 562.51pt, "vacuum-failure detection application in confined spaces in automobiles or aeronautics. Finally, ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 583.27pt, "by extrapolating the optimized output power and with a CAD-assisted assembly of a large TEG ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 603.94pt, "module (1000 cm")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 8.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(155.42pt, 599.35pt, "2")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(159.5pt, 603.94pt, "), the potential of scalable low-grade waste heat recovery is discussed. ")
  #line-at(75.144pt, 632.62pt, "Keywords: thermoelectric generators (TEGs); carbogel; vacuum insulation panel; waste heat ")
  #line-at(276.65pt, 647.5pt, "recovery")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 14.04pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(88.824pt, 672.34pt, "1.")
  #line-at(106.82pt, 672.34pt, "Main")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(70.824pt, 702.58pt, "Climate change and the increased global power demand is further exacerbated by the unabated ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 723.34pt, "depletion of fossil fuel resources, thus making this world an entity craving for energy and ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 743.976pt, "simultaneously struggling for its existence due to the consequences of fossil fuel energy ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 764.736pt, "consumption [1]. Since more than 2/3rd of the used fossil energy is lost as waste heat, ")
