  #line-at(70.824pt, 517.51pt, "graphene sheets and the pyrolyzed RF matrix, due to the presence of this energy barrier. ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 538.27pt, "Therefore, only charge carriers with higher energy than the potential barrier can move, while ")
