  #line-at(70.824pt, 254.42pt, "The synthesis of our RF xerogel using acid catalysis and evaporative drying process was carried ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 275.09pt, "out according to the following steps: ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 303.77pt, "- 20.38 g of resorcinol (R), (Fisher, 98%) are first dissolved in 200 ml of water in a cups of 500 ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 324.53pt, "ml. ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 353.21pt, "- 5.0 g of pDADMAC (P) are added to the R + water mixture. ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 381.89pt, "- After magnetic stirring, the pH is generally close to 6. It is then adjusted to 2 by slow addition ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 402.53pt, "of a catalyst solution (C) of HCl (10 M). ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 431.35pt, "- Then 30.02 g of formaldehyde (F), (Aldrich, 37% by weight in water, stabilized by 10-15% ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 451.99pt, "of methanol) are added to the mixture. ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 480.67pt, "- The solution is then mixed by magnetic stirring before being poured into a mold which is ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 501.43pt, "subsequently closed hermetically. ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 530.11pt, "- Subsequently, the mold is placed in an oven at 90°C for 24 hours. ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 558.79pt, "- This mold is then opened and the aqueous gel obtained is then dried by evaporation in an air ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 579.55pt, "oven at 90°C for another 24 hours. ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 608.26pt, "- At the end of these steps, the RF xerogel is obtained in the form of a plate corresponding to a ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 628.9pt, "mold with a thickness of 1 cm and a side of 15 cm. ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 657.58pt, "These steps are summarized through the summary diagram below (Figure 10): ")
]

